// Title: Atbroker Registry Change
// Sigma ID: 9577edbb-851f-4243-8c91-1d5b50c1a39b
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Mateusz Wydra, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-13 | Modified: 2023-01-19
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, stealth, T1218, persistence, T1547
// Description: Detects creation/modification of Assistive Technology applications and persistence with usage of
//   'at'
// False positives:
//   - Creation of non-default, legitimate at usage
// References:
//   - http://www.hexacorn.com/blog/2016/07/22/beyond-good-ol-run-key-part-42/
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Atbroker/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_susp_atbroker_change.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey contains "Software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Accessibility\\ATs" or RegistryKey contains "Software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Accessibility\\Configuration") and (not(((InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\Windows\\system32\\atbroker.exe" and RegistryKey contains "\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Accessibility\\Configuration" and RegistryValueData =~ "(Empty)") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath startswith "C:\\Windows\\Installer\\MSI" and RegistryKey contains "Software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Accessibility\\ATs"))))
